omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RVBbezLVWfIQ7kNvwGYYwXp&_nc_oc=Adr9ra7D6Y8U6DCSRdibJ5j3kNA7IgL7nynyhEwKLl30i5TE3RslKsVO5iujZPXtykk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAvsF7QiwoaVPbUX6WCrlXOG_OT_eVovd-1K5geVpRZWA&oe=6A576D74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeLgjdYUGh8Q7kNvwGx44gl&_nc_oc=Adq6tPqtLVnvZ89heQVsMjth-ZERp4XwtXfGxmag7lFnOugCoCrZdBGT66T4KKqNucU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDnRGNkkM5dhklC99hX6_WrBqXsAAceSArpWaEwd_MxbA&oe=6A576ED6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJ70l6D27uEQ7kNvwFkUpXw&_nc_oc=Adr0KPY9Sjncp6bcq4HzrK3huST8dCZdCxlnvTcu5DNf2NJgqTrei4hPIld69DvO1rQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC0PDGQd29NCAU_F1kFEXja5D5vPoQxLwGCUC-VPm3i6g&oe=6A5783F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://